{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-83","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-83-talk-403815811-line","text":"你看着眼前的图景：黑森林在下雨，每片叶子上都挂着露水。这雨令你感到哀伤。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-83-talk-403815812-line","text":"你在黑森林淋着小雨，一路兜兜转转，走到路边的铁匠铺旁。一台制造机正痴迷于制作火漆，它专心于敲着手中的小锤子——直到你的到来打断了它。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-83-talk-403815813-line","text":"「你想问我火漆的事吗？」它目光如炬。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-83-text-8215102753747750102-choice","text":"火漆熔铸。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-83-text-8296498187355253174-choice","text":"火漆祝福。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-83-text-8844199364278516709-choice","text":"火漆强化。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-83-talk-403815818-line","text":"「再过百年，我依然在这里生产火漆。」制造机说道，接着继续埋头锤它的小锤子。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"}]}
